# Live Compose stack — only when attached in the Dev Container

Applies only when the agent runs **inside** the `engine` container (Dev Container
attach). Host (WSL) agents use `scripts/run` / `scripts/compose` per `AGENTS.md`.

Inside the container, recreating the attached stack hangs the agent:

- Do not `docker compose up` / `down` / `stop` / `restart` / `--force-recreate` the
  `aura-workbench_devcontainer` project.
- Use `docker compose … exec -T <service> …` for sibling services; `build` is fine.
- New mounts or image changes: ask the user to rebuild/reopen the Dev Container.
